61199083170538", "personaname": "[Ɛ:_KaliszJan_;3]", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199083170538/", "num_games_owned": 113, "num_reviews": 84, "playtime_forever": 2479, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2479, "last_played": 1771889257, "avatar": "f46a7ef0f2d3cb1c5c83d33525b17924963b28d8"}, "language": "english", "review": "A pretty good remaster that outshines the original in every way, The pixel art is really really good here, every character and environment has received a massive glow up, The UI is so much better and there's a bunch of new gameplay options you can mess around with.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately there's a big underlying issue at this game's core that wasn't changed much from the original, that being the fact that the gameplay loop of this game is still repetitive and boring, runs all feel samey mostly due to the fact that the items just don't make them very unique and there's still only one final boss and one ending.\r\n\r\nThe providence trials are a nice addition but range vastly in quality with a lot of uninteresting or really badly designed challenges. Also having to do the final trial with each character is just annoying, it's not even particularly hard to beat but really time consuming.\r\n\r\n6/10 Not great but a lot better than the first", "timestamp_created": 1774204728, "timestamp_updated": 1774204728, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.55643916130065918", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "221362818", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045732281", "personaname": "Bait", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BaitWizard/", "num_games_owned": 184, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 5708, "playtime_last_tw